{"unit_id":"gameswu__dsh-cross-collaboration#card-zh","repo":"gameswu/dsh-cross-collaboration","commit":"5607af6c41e5da7ff439787c58433620cf933ea5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cross-collaboration 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的跨设备协作插件。它在主机侧启动网络网关，并提供 LAN 协作设置面板与两个 Agent 工具。设备可在局域网自动发现，也可手动添加地址；lan_peers 用于查看设备、工作区和主会话，lan_message 可向指定设备或会话发送消息。已知离线设备的消息会进入持久化队列并在重新连接后补投，也可选择配置 WebSocket 中继。适合需要让多台 DSH 设备上的 Agent 互相传递任务信息的用户。使用时配置 UDP 发现端口，跨网段可手动添加节点；中继和配对口令均为可选。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.ts:152-157","src/host.ts:993-1098","src/client.ts:779-827","src/queue.ts:14-56"]}
{"unit_id":"gameswu__dsh-cross-collaboration#card-en","repo":"gameswu/dsh-cross-collaboration","commit":"5607af6c41e5da7ff439787c58433620cf933ea5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cross-collaboration connects DSH devices for agent messaging. Discover LAN peers, inspect their root sessions, and send a message to a chosen device or session. Messages for known offline peers are queued and retried. An optional WebSocket relay supports other network layouts.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.ts:152-157","src/host.ts:993-1098","src/queue.ts:14-56"]}
